hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1071","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi hai jo darkht lagaaey ya kheti ugaey, phir us mein se parinda ya insaan ya jaanwar khaey magar wo uskey liye sadqa hoga. (Bukhari: 2320)"
"1072","[AI-translation] Abu Umaama Baahili (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne hal aur kheti key aalaat mein se kuchh dekha. To unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Ye kisi qaum key ghar mein daakhil nahi hota magar Allah us mein zillat daakhil kar deta hai. (Bukhari: 2321)"
"1073","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kutta rakkhey to beshak uskey amal mein se har din qeeraat kam hota hai, magar kheti ya maweshiyon ka kutta. (Bukhari: 2322)"
"1074","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai: Magar bakriyon ya kheti ya shikaar ka kutta. (Bukhari: 2322)"
"1075","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai: Magar shikaar ya maweshiyon ka kutta. (Bukhari: 2322)"
"1076","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jabke aik aadmi gaey par sawaar tha ke us ne uski taraf munh kar key kaha: Main iskey liye paida nahi ki gai hun, kheti baadi key liye paida ki gai hun. Aap ne farmaya: Main us par imaan laaya, main aur Abu Bakr aur Umar. Aur bhediye ne bakri pakad li. To charwaaha uskey peechey gaya. To bhediye ne us se kaha: Darindon waley din uski kaun (hifaazat karega), jis din merey siwa uska koi charwaaha na hoga. Aap ne farmaya: Main us par imaan laaya, main aur Abu Bakr aur Umar. (Bukhari: 2324)"
"1077","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ansaar ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Hamaarey aur hamaarey bhaiyon key darmiyaan khajoorein taqseem kar dijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum hamaari mehnat kaafi ho jao aur ham tumhey phal mein shareek karengey. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne suna aur itaat ki. (Bukhari: 2325)"
"1078","[AI-translation] Raafe bin Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Madina walon mein sab se zyada kheti baadi waley they. Ham zameen ko uskey kinarey key muqarrar hissey par kiraayey par detey they jo zameen key maalik key liye hota. Unhon-ne kaha: To us mein se wo (hissa) aafat mein aata aur zameen bach jaati. Aur us mein se zameen aafat mein aati aur wo (hissa) bach jaata. To hamein mana kar diya gaya. Aur sona aur chaandi us din na they. (Bukhari: 2327)"
"1079","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar walon se us phal ya kheti key aadhey par muamla kya jo us se nikalta. To Aap apni biwiyon ko sau wasaq detey they: Assi wasaq khajoor aur bees wasaq jau. (Bukhari: 2328)"
"1080","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kiraayey se mana nahi kya, lekin farmaya: Ye ke tum mein se koi apne bhai ko (muft) dey wo uskey liye behtar hai is se ke wo us se muqarrar kiraaya ley. (Bukhari: 2330)"
"1081","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Agar aakhri Musalman na hotey to main koi basti fatah na karta magar use uskey rehne walon key darmiyaan taqseem karta jaisey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar taqseem ki thi. (Bukhari: 2334)"
"1082","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo banjar zameen ko aabaad karey jo kisi ki nahi hai to wo uska zyada haqdaar hai. (Bukhari: 2335)"
"1083","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne Yahood aur Nasaara ko Hijaaz ki zameen se nikaal diya. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Khaibar par ghaalib huey to Yahood ko us se nikaalna chaaha. Aur zameen jab us par ghalba hua Allah key aur uskey Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key aur Musalmaanon key liye thi. Aur Aap ne Yahood ko us se nikaalna chaaha. To Yahood ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maanga ke wo unhey us mein rehne dein, wo uska kaam karengey aur unkey liye aadha phal hoga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Ham tumhey us mein rehne dengey is par jab tak ham chaahein. To wo us mein rahey yahan tak ke Umar ne unhey Taima aur Areeha ki taraf nikaal diya. (Bukhari: 2338)"
"1084","[AI-translation] Raafe bin Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey chacha Zuhair bin Raafe (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein aisey kaam se mana kya tha jo hamaarey liye faeda mand tha. Main ne kaha: Jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha wo haq hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey bulaaya. Aap ne farmaya: Tum apni khetiyon key sath kya kartey ho? Main ne kaha: Ham unhey chauthaai aur khajoor aur jau key wasaqon par kiraayey par detey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na karo. Use boo ya buwaao ya rokey rakkho. Raafe ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Suna aur itaat ki. (Bukhari: 2339)"
"1085","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar aur Usmaan key zamaaney mein aur Muawiya ki hukumat key shuru hissey mein apni khetiyaan kiraayey par detey they. Phir unhey Raafe bin Khadeej se bayan kya gaya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khetiyon key kiraayey se mana kya hai. To Ibn Umar Raafe ki taraf gaey aur un se poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khetiyon key kiraayey se mana kya hai. To Ibn Umar ne kaha: Beshak tum jaan chukey ho ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein apni khetiyaan naaliyon par jo hai aur thodi bhoosi key badley kiraayey par detey they. (Bukhari: 2343)"
"1086","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein jaanta tha ke zameen kiraayey par di jaati hai. Phir Abdullah ko khauf hua ke shayed Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uskey baarey mein koi nai baat kahi ho jo wo na jaantey hon. To unhon-ne zameen ka kiraaya chhor diya. (Bukhari: 2345)"
"1087","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din hadees bayan kar rahey they jabke Aap key paas dehaat walon mein se aik aadmi tha: Ke Jannat walon mein se aik aadmi ne apne Rab se kheti ki ijazat maangi. To us ne us se kaha: Kya tum jo chaaaho us mein nahi ho? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahi, lekin main kheti karna pasand karta hun. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne boya. To uska ugna aur uska baraabar hona aur uska katna nigaah key palak jhapakney mein tha. To wo pahaadon jaisa ho gaya. To Allah farmaata hai: Lo ae Aadam key betey! Beshak tumhey koi cheez ser nahi karti. To dehaati ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tum use Quraishi ya Ansaari key siwa na paaogey, beshak wo kheti waley hain. Aur ham kheti waley nahi hain. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hansay. (Bukhari: 2348). Paani pilaanay ki kitaab."
